# BFN pre-commit hook (Req 16.8, 17.6, 17.7)
# Runs staged-file quality checks and a staged-secret scan. Both must complete
# well within the 120s budget. Any failure exits non-zero and blocks the commit
# while leaving the staged changes unchanged.

# 1) Block commits that would introduce secrets.
node scripts/secret-scan.mjs || exit 1

# 2) Lint + format only the staged files (fast, scoped to the diff).
pnpm exec lint-staged || exit 1
